' Run test: the file viewer in examples/viewer, built from its own file,
' in a folder holding viewer.files' two files (dated 2 Jan 2026 by the
' test runner). Keys: the first file is shown at once; Down shows the
' second; Ctrl+L turns line numbers off; File > Open folder... a folder
' that is not there, refused with a MsgBox, on which the script ends.
Name=viewer
Startup=frmViewer
Form=../../examples/viewer/viewer.bas
